[["heading","REFERENCES AND SCOPE\nFurther reading"],["heading","Original learning sources"],["text","Full_Stack_SE_Internship_Checklist.pdf, Section 31;\nSections_04-34_Full_Stack_Interview_Study_Guide.pdf, pp. 88–90; Awantha Imesh_Intern\nDeveloper.pdf, professional experience."],["heading","Official external references"],["text","LGPS information: https://lgpsinfo.lankagate.gov.lk/"],["text","PCI SSC FAQ 1154 and 1210: https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/faqs/1154/\nhttps://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/faqs/1210/"],["text","OWASP Webhook Security Cheat Sheet: OWASP Webhook Security Cheat Sheet"],["heading","Scope"],["text","The additional 17 concepts are selected for full-stack internship interviews. They supplement, not\nreplace, the original 15 and previous 5. Code snippets are illustrative pseudocode or fragments\nunless explicitly tested. Diagrams are static conceptual illustrations. Consult the actual provider\ncontract before implementing any payment integration."],["sinhala","","Interview එJක් definitions මතක තබනොJග/ diagrams අඳින්/. ඔයනොJගේ project එකට අදෙනොල සැබෑ",479],["sinhala","","implementation එක Jව/ම revise කරන්/.",220]]